 " \[LongDash] ",
 "a scene solved on a graph, step by step; a List of InfraSceneInstance \
bindings, one per admissible combination"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"4dfca659-50da-4aee-8322-f6a48b1ac417"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
